MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 83a00ca90370b6442a427a8851926dcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainStory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SO_Story
  dialogueTexts:
  - KnotName: Dessin d'enfant
    texts:
    - 'Dad, Saga and I. He gave her to me as a parting gift probably, saying she''d
      protect me. '
    - He must have felt he wouldn't come back. Saga does her job very well, I hope
      he's proud.
  - KnotName: Balle en cuir
    texts:
    - 'I made this ball for her our first spring together. '
    - I had never sown on leather before, and getting the sand inside made a real
      mess in my room.
    - Saga loves it, it is in much better shape than I remember though...
  - KnotName: Missing Object
    texts:
    - Object required is missing
  - KnotName: Os humain
    texts:
    - 'Saga brought this home after her first battle.  '
    - I had my doubts bringing her with me, scared she might end up wounded.
    - 'She revealed herself to be a true warrior in the end.  '
    - Had to make her sleep in the shed for weeks for she didn't want to leave her
      trophy, and the stentch of the flesh was unbearable.
    - She plays with it still, like with a common woodstick.
  - KnotName: "D\xE9bris/Morceau de chemin\xE9"
    texts:
    - 'This appeared a few weeks ago during the night. We heard it crash and Saga
      acted wary until the next day.  '
    - 'She still growls at it when we pass by. '
  - KnotName: Morceau de drapeau ennemi
    texts:
    - 'Saga brought this the other day, after wandering off alone for a few hours. '
    - 'Dad showed me something similar before leaving, warned to never trust one
      who bore those marks and colors. '
    - They're supposed to live weeks away from here.
  - KnotName: "Pointe de fl\xE8che"
    texts:
    - What a keepsake. Your first battle wound, a scar to be proud of. You used to
      scare me, charging in like a beast.
    - ' I know now no wound can take you out....I hope.'
  - KnotName: Collier
    texts:
    - 'I had this made for her by the leathersmith of the nearest town. The medalion
      was my work. '
    - Although it is sloppy, I wanted her to wear something made by my hand. She
      left bare necked that day...
  - KnotName: Talharpa
    texts:
    - Your howls matched the music so well, I miss the melodies we made.
    - I want to play together again.
    - I can't wait...
